{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1539752d95db37910a8674ea3a10948a046b3320d690001bac5abfe75eab8ee0", "ja": "ドラマの撮影で忙しい中、新曲の公演も引き\n受ける恵美。恋がテーマの曲に悩むが、プロ\nデューサーや琴葉、エレナと話す内に答えを\n掴む。公演を経て、ふと大人びた表情を見せ\nた恵美に、プロデューサーは驚くのだった。", "zh": "恵美在忙于电视剧拍摄的同时，还接下了\n新曲公演的工作。尽管她为恋爱主题的歌曲\n感到烦恼，但还是在与制作人、琴叶以及\n艾蕾娜的交谈中找到了答案。公演结束后，\n看到惠美不经意间流露出的大人般的成熟神情，\n制作人感到十分吃惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3bf567d3bec1d63a1e17014672383a313e2eec2330fe31216fea9cbd8970cfc7", "ja": "（恵美の新曲披露公演が、幕を閉じた！　ステージを\n降りた後も、お客さんの拍手と歓声が止まない……）", "zh": "（惠美的新歌首演公演落下了帷幕！下台之后，观众们的掌声和欢呼声也久久没有停歇……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae9baa5db5a91abc2967ae2c7fa63fe00d7eecd3f778950a405ffac1c39dbcd2", "ja": "{$P$}\nねぇ、アタシの歌どうだった？", "zh": "{$P$}\n呐，我唱得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1002_p", "source_sha256": "01e20f3e4b1d40bc97a761cafb5a13a30426cf8ee7c8b741dc143c7152f4e02c", "ja": "お疲れさま、恵美。うん、すごくよかったよ。何より、\nいい公演だったのは、お客さんが証明してるしな！", "zh": "辛苦了，惠美。嗯，真的很棒。最重要的是，演出很成功，客人们已经证明了这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "eaa697ce664e33a683d2208e74ff6b77a83aac5977b9d9fd4d8c6b3fa21927f1", "ja": "うん……そうだよね。\n{$P$}、ありがとっ！　へへっ。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。{$P$}，谢谢你！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "e060bd178d2cac1c89ebddb8de3511bc8b346211153e60eccc1be276757a662e", "ja": "メグミ～、お疲れさま！\n今日のステージ、最高に楽しかったヨ～！", "zh": "惠美～，辛苦啦！\n今天的舞台，真的超级开心哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "76b8a457123e1216cfe00b7e9d5dbac4c594495c865bb130be11923a98a4cb68", "ja": "レッスンの時は悩んでたけど、全然心配なかったね。\n恵美、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "虽然排练时还在烦恼，不过完全不用担心呢。\n惠美，真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "abaff6a8c93da46803c6f94f6b11781c75d8887424cdd063ec5bbf3eae25698d", "ja": "はい！　恵美さんの新曲……\n本当に、切ないラブストーリーそのものでした！", "zh": "是的！惠美的新歌……\n真的就像一段令人心酸的爱情故事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "45325b26ca09acc0dcc66cbaabeb2e146581e4d859b9cb466813c38493e973e5", "ja": "うん……お話を、見てるみたいだった……\n恵美さん……すごいね……。", "zh": "嗯……就像是在看故事一样……\n惠美姐……好厉害啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "1c087e1b499b522e6c89cfa378610ba3a5b6fd721d78613221dbb8eb58904d80", "ja": "にゃはは♪\nそんなにほめられると、なんか照れるな～。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪\n被这么夸，总觉得有点不好意思呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1f8caa91fc55b9302e1d6a3e408d06df09723bfca22fdd8041c49b8ba41d2337", "ja": "それだけ恵美自身に、歌の世界を表現する力が\n身についたって事だと思う。", "zh": "我觉得，这也说明惠美自己已经具备了表现歌声世界的能力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fd3497d23af663e14ba4a81d3ce3794a180a4c01de85d43943b861bc4fc41d11", "ja": "アイドルとして、一歩成長したんだよ。\n喜ばしい事じゃないか。", "zh": "作为偶像，她又成长了一步。不是件值得高兴的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b2f97e634d6d5ae51b36bf7bae5e4e963b200a73895964d7625864651ef3b3dd", "ja": "歌が違うように、表現の仕方は人それぞれだけど……\nみんなも、恵美に負けないように頑張らないとな！", "zh": "就像歌曲各不相同，表达方式也是因人而异……大家也得努力，不能输给惠美才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
