{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "9a66fa3e0cd967ba0727f24de8d0604fc06d0f37c78b85701148754dece19ea4", "ja": "あ、うん。えっと……\n{$P$}、ありがとね。", "zh": "啊，嗯。那个……\n{$P$}，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "0feb9135dc83713be22a80a4b0f65eb7258a4a21e06281d23081b1f4085737b0", "ja": "アタシが新曲をちゃんと歌えたの、\n{$P$}のおかげだと思うから。", "zh": "我觉得，都是多亏了{$P$}，我才能好好唱完新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1023_p", "source_sha256": "618b7fd24a4e4c15ed4bb5412f61d37629a1414ae4415a635a0325b3a0b10d93", "ja": "俺は、いつもどおりサポートしただけだ。\nだから公演が成功したのは、恵美の努力の結果だよ。", "zh": "我只是像往常一样提供了支持而已。所以公演能成功，是惠美努力的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "b7e0e524769c5fcad124cd561a2a15f266bc74c06e190ea6526751de84c09cf7", "ja": "うん……ありがと！　たしかに、それもあるとは\n思うんだけど。……あ、あのさ……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你！虽然我也觉得\n确实有那方面的原因啦。……那、那个啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
