{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "a4c296da28f198520e7841bfaee17eedde0f3c6c24a92ab575cc30366c233ffa", "ja": "メグミ～？　行かないノ？\n主役がいないと、打ち上げ始まらないヨ～！", "zh": "惠美～？还不走吗？\n主角不在的话，庆功宴就没法开始啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "4974664d03da3bddd5debb6540528a4a60facc1f0510c85d64fc4145e031c92e", "ja": "あ、うん！\n……んじゃ、アタシも着替えてくるね！", "zh": "啊，嗯！\n……那我也去换衣服啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ad05b83e2f98bae6a8d3dab0f0941ea69a3d85071e1754fd206d1b7876a1f513", "ja": "（この公演と、ドラマの撮影とを通して、\n恵美は以前より大人びてきた気がする）", "zh": "通过这场演出和电视剧的拍摄，感觉惠美比以前更成熟了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_070_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_070_1029_p", "source_sha256": "48427c64c2ad37f007781ea54d5a2671abfb6e791b66e214a21750386d4e584c", "ja": "（成長を見守れるのは、プロデューサーとして何より\n嬉しい事だけど……追い越されないようにしないとな）", "zh": "（能作为制作人见证她的成长，是再高兴不过的事了……不过，我也得努力别被她超过才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
